OL,3,ANeil Young sues Trump campaign again
OL,4,Afor playing Rockin' in the Free World
OL,5,Aat rally
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe singer-songwriter sued the Trump
OL,8,Fre-election campaign in 2020 over its
OL,9,Fuse of the same song and Devil's
OL,10,FSidewalk. Young said the parties
OL,11,Fsettled the matter shortly thereafter.
OL,13,FThe BBC has contacted the Republican
OL,14,FNational Committee for comment.
